The files here are the ONNX export republished as
https://huggingface.co/Xenova/ms-marco-TinyBERT-L-2-v2, which is what
`crates/oracle-core/src/model_download.rs` fetches. The export carries the
licence of the base model above.

This licence covers the third-party weights and tokenizer only. It does not
apply to `model_config.json` in this directory, which is a descriptor written
for this project and covered by the repository's own LICENSE and NOTICE.
